---
title: "Where does each worked minute land in the two charts?"
accTitle: "Routing one counted minute into the Roots and Types charts"
accDescr: "Every counted on-clock minute lands once in the Roots chart and once in the Types chart. In Roots, a minute with no known root goes to a hatched unlinked series that never takes a top-N slot; a known root in the period's top N keeps its own series; any other root folds into a light N more series. In Types, a minute whose Pomodoro name has configured types splits evenly across those types, and labels take no share; otherwise it goes to a hatched untyped series."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 240
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph ROOTS["Roots chart: each minute counted once"]
    direction TD
    RQ1{{"`**Root known?**`"}}
    RQ2{{"`**In period's top N?**`"}}
    RUN["`**unlinked**, hatched<br/>never takes a top-N slot`"]
    ROWN["`**Own root series**<br/>same keys in every column`"]
    RMORE["`**N more**, light neutral<br/>members listed on focus`"]
    RQ1 -->|"No: unlinked or unfiled"| RUN
    RQ1 -->|Yes| RQ2
    RQ2 -->|Yes| ROWN
    RQ2 -->|No| RMORE
  end
  subgraph TYPES["Types chart: each minute counted once"]
    direction TD
    TQ{{"`**Name has configured types?**`"}}
    TOWN["`**Each configured type**<br/>equal share; labels get none`"]
    TUN["`**untyped**, hatched<br/>unnamed or labels only`"]
    TQ -->|Yes| TOWN
    TQ -->|No| TUN
  end
  ROOTS ~~~ TYPES
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C77C02,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3000
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class RQ1,RQ2,TQ decision
  class ROWN,TOWN outcome
  class RUN,RMORE,TUN muted
  style ROOTS fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style TYPES fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
